msgstr "Pregledi stranica"

#: includes/admin.php:236
msgid "Most viewed this month"
msgstr "Najčitanije ovog mjeseca"

#: includes/admin.php:245
msgid "All statistics →"
msgstr "Sva statistika →"

#: includes/admin.php:296
msgid "Previous URLs"
msgstr "Stari URL-ovi"

#: includes/admin.php:299
msgid ""
"One per line. Views of these addresses are added to this page, e.g. after "
"moving it. Old slugs of posts are added automatically."
msgstr ""
"Jedan po retku. Pregledi tih adresa pribrajaju se ovoj stranici, npr. nakon "
"selidbe. Stari slugovi objava dodaju se automatski."

