#: includes/settings.php:17 includes/settings.php:140
msgid "Awstatium settings"
msgstr "Awstatium postavke"

#: includes/settings.php:42
msgid ""
"Some AWStats files were skipped because they are incomplete. Details are in "
"the PHP error log."
msgstr "Neke AWStats datoteke su preskočene jer su nepotpune. Detalji su u PHP error logu."

#: includes/settings.php:56
msgid "The previous settings were kept."
msgstr "Prijašnje postavke su zadržane."

#: includes/settings.php:58
msgid "Please enter the AWStats data directory and config."
msgstr "Upišite mapu s AWStats podacima i konfiguraciju."

#. translators: %s: directory path
#: includes/settings.php:61
#, php-format
msgid "The directory %s does not exist or PHP is not allowed to read it."
msgstr "Mapa %s ne postoji ili je PHP ne smije čitati."

#. translators: 1: AWStats config name, 2: directory path
#: includes/settings.php:66
#, php-format
msgid "No AWStats files for config %1$s were found in %2$s."
msgstr "Za konfiguraciju %1$s u mapi %2$s nema AWStats datoteka."

#. translators: %s: directory path
#: includes/settings.php:69
#, php-format
msgid "The AWStats files in %s could not be read."
msgstr "AWStats datoteke u mapi %s ne mogu se pročitati."

#: includes/settings.php:89
msgid ""
"Another refresh is running. The new data will be loaded in the background in "
"a minute."
msgstr "Upravo je u tijeku drugo osvježavanje. Novi podaci učitat će se u pozadini za minutu."

#: includes/settings.php:102
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Postavke"

#: includes/settings.php:125
msgid "Reload AWStats data"
msgstr "Ponovno učitaj AWStats podatke"

#: includes/settings.php:144
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Stanje"

#: includes/settings.php:148
msgid "AWStats files found"
msgstr "Pronađene AWStats datoteke"

#: includes/settings.php:150
msgid "None – check the directory and config below."
msgstr "Nijedna – provjerite mapu i konfiguraciju ispod."

#: includes/settings.php:151
msgid "Months loaded"
msgstr "Učitani mjeseci"

#: includes/settings.php:153
msgid "Last AWStats update"
msgstr "Zadnje osvježavanje AWStatsa"

#: includes/settings.php:155
msgid "Permalinks"
msgstr "Stalne veze"

#: includes/settings.php:155
msgid ""
"Plain permalinks (?p=123) are in use. AWStats ignores query strings, so "
"views per page cannot be counted. Choose another structure in Settings → "
"Permalinks."
msgstr ""
"Koriste se obične stalne veze (?p=123). AWStats zanemaruje parametre u "
"adresi, pa se pregledi po stranici ne mogu brojati. Odaberite drugu "
"strukturu u Postavke → Stalne veze."

#: includes/settings.php:158
msgid ""
"PHP can only read these directories. If the AWStats directory is outside "
"them, ask your host or copy the files to an allowed directory with a cron "
"job."
msgstr ""
"PHP smije čitati samo ove mape. Ako je AWStats mapa izvan njih, obratite se "
"hostingu ili cron zadatkom kopirajte datoteke u dopuštenu mapu."

#: includes/settings.php:168
msgid "AWStats data directory"
msgstr "Mapa s AWStats podacima"

#: includes/settings.php:170
msgid ""
"Directory with files named awstatsMMYYYY.example.com.txt. On cPanel this is "
"usually ~/tmp/awstats/ssl (HTTPS) or ~/tmp/awstats (HTTP)."
msgstr ""
"Mapa s datotekama imena awstatsMMYYYY.primjer.hr.txt. Na cPanelu je to "
"obično ~/tmp/awstats/ssl (HTTPS) ili ~/tmp/awstats (HTTP)."

#: includes/settings.php:177
msgid "Found on this server:"
msgstr "Pronađeno na ovom poslužitelju:"

#: includes/settings.php:181 includes/settings.php:198
msgid "Use"
msgstr "Koristi"

#: includes/settings.php:188
msgid "AWStats config"
msgstr "AWStats konfiguracija"

#: includes/settings.php:190
msgid ""
"The middle part of the file names, usually your domain. Addon domains on "
"cPanel look like example.com.maindomain.com."
msgstr ""
"Srednji dio imena datoteka, obično vaša domena. Dodatne domene na cPanelu "
"izgledaju ovako: primjer.hr.glavnadomena.hr."

#: includes/settings.php:193
msgid "In this directory:"
msgstr "U ovoj mapi:"

#. translators: %s: number of monthly files
#: includes/settings.php:196
#, php-format
msgid "%s month"
msgid_plural "%s months"
msgstr[0] "%s mjesec"
msgstr[1] "%s mjeseca"
msgstr[2] "%s mjeseci"

#: includes/settings.php:205
msgid "Show views automatically"
msgstr "Automatski prikaži preglede"

#: includes/settings.php:210
msgid "Position:"
msgstr "Položaj:"

#: includes/settings.php:211
msgid "Below the content"
msgstr "Ispod sadržaja"

#: includes/settings.php:212
msgid "Above the content"
msgstr "Iznad sadržaja"

#: includes/settings.php:214
msgid ""
"Adds e.g. \"1,234 views\" to single posts of the selected types. It is "
"hidden while the count is 0. You can also use the [awstatium_views] "
"shortcode or awstatium_get_views() in your theme."
msgstr ""
"Dodaje npr. „1.234 pregleda“ na pojedinačne objave odabranih vrsta. Ne "
"prikazuje se dok je broj 0. Možete koristiti i shortcode [awstatium_views] "
"ili awstatium_get_views() u temi."

#: includes/settings.php:218
msgid "Admin lists"
msgstr "Popisi u adminu"

#: includes/settings.php:219
msgid "Show a sortable Views column in the lists of posts and pages"
msgstr "Prikaži stupac Pregledi s mogućnošću sortiranja u popisima objava i stranica"

#: includes/settings.php:222
msgid "Page cache"
msgstr "Predmemorija stranica"

#: includes/settings.php:223
msgid "Purge the page cache when new AWStats data arrives"
msgstr "Očisti predmemoriju stranica kad stignu novi AWStats podaci"

#: includes/settings.php:224
msgid ""
"Supports LiteSpeed Cache, WP Rocket, W3 Total Cache, WP Super Cache, Cache "
"Enabler and SiteGround Speed Optimizer. Other plugins can use the "
"awstatium_purge_cache action."
msgstr ""
"Podržava LiteSpeed Cache, WP Rocket, W3 Total Cache, WP Super Cache, Cache "
"Enabler i SiteGround Speed Optimizer. Drugi plugini mogu koristiti akciju "
"awstatium_purge_cache."

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Page views, downloads and traffic statistics from your server's AWStats "
"data. No tracking scripts, no cookies."
msgstr ""
"Pregledi stranica, preuzimanja i statistika posjećenosti iz AWStats podataka "
"vašeg poslužitelja. Bez skripti za praćenje i bez kolačića."
